{"_v":1,"id":"jesus-christ-superstar-west-end-2026","cat":"west-end","cs":74.77,"rc":16,"bd":{"positive":12,"mixed":3,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Andrzej Lukowski","o":"Time Out London","s":74,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/news/jesus-christ-superstar-palladium-2026-070726","d":"2026-07-07","q":"All in all it's a good production that slots into the Jamie Lloyd era of Sexy Lloyd Webber very nicely indeed. The problem, I'm afraid, is the lead."},{"cn":"Alex Wood","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/news/jesus-christ-superstar-with-sam-ryder-begins-performances-at-the-london-palladium_1725578/","d":"2026-06-22"},{"cn":"Alun Hood","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/news/jesus-christ-superstar-with-sam-ryder-begins-performances-at-the-london-palladium_1725578/","d":"2026-06-22"},{"cn":"Jonas Schwartz","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/news/jesus-christ-superstar-with-sam-ryder-begins-performances-at-the-london-palladium_1725578/","d":"2026-06-22"},{"cn":"Judi Herman","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/news/jesus-christ-superstar-with-sam-ryder-begins-performances-at-the-london-palladium_1725578/","d":"2026-06-22"},{"cn":"Matt Barton","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/news/jesus-christ-superstar-with-sam-ryder-begins-performances-at-the-london-palladium_1725578/","d":"2026-06-22"},{"cn":"Matt Trueman","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/news/jesus-christ-superstar-with-sam-ryder-begins-performances-at-the-london-palladium_1725578/","d":"2026-06-22"},{"cn":"Sarah Crompton","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/news/did-sam-ryder-reach-for-the-stars-jesus-christ-superstar-review-round-up_1726870/","d":"2026-06-22"},{"cn":"Unknown","o":"The Arts Desk","s":81,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"http://theartsdesk.com/theatre/jesus-christ-superstar-london-palladium-review-febrile-classic-captures-burning-energy-original?amp","q":"The performer who stands out throughout is Desmonda Cathabel as Mary Magdalene, who has a voice like liquid gold and a powerful, empathetic presence."},{"cn":"Stuart King","o":"London Box Office","s":77,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.londonboxoffice.co.uk/news/post/jesus-christ-superstar-london-palladium-review","d":"2026-07-08","q":"In all, a terrific effort, albeit once again over amplified."},{"cn":"Greg Stewart","o":"Theatre Weekly","s":58,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://theatreweekly.com/review-jesus-christ-superstar-at-the-london-palladium/","d":"2026-07-07","q":"Ultimately, this Jesus Christ Superstar is a slick and visually striking revival that too often mistakes scale for substance."},{"cn":"London Palladium","o":"London Theatre","s":44,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatrereviews.co.uk/post.cfm?p=28304","d":"2026-07-07","q":"It is an evening that feels more like an uneven, slightly muted concert than a fully realised, transcendent piece of musical theatre."},{"cn":"Olivia Garrett","o":"Radio Times","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://www.radiotimes.com/going-out/going-out-reviews/jesus-christ-superstar-review/","d":"2026-07-08","q":"Go see it instantly and then go see it again."},{"cn":"Louise Penn","o":"Cambridge","s":89,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://loureviews.blog/2026/07/08/sam-ryder-and-jesus-christ-superstar/","d":"2026-07-07","q":"This production is easily five-star. It is well-designed, scored and presented."},{"cn":"Stephanie Osztreicher","o":"West End Best Friend","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.westendbestfriend.co.uk/news/review-jesus-christ-superstar-london-palladium","d":"2026-07-08","q":"This production does not radically reinterpret Jesus Christ Superstar. Instead, it reminds us why the work has endured for over fifty years."},{"cn":"All That Dazzles","o":"All That Dazzles  (UK)","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":3,"u":"https://www.allthatdazzles.co.uk/post/review-jesus-christ-superstar-london-palladium","d":"2026-07-07","q":"Though it isn't anywhere near so bad that you could say the show has been crucified, it's fair to say this version of Jesus Christ Superstar doesn't quite manage to exceed expectations."}],"au":{"score":87.03,"designation":"Liking","sources":{"lb":{"s":96,"c":20,"sr":4.8},"mz":{"s":85,"c":341,"sr":4.3},"sp":{"s":89,"c":115,"sr":4.47},"ss":{"s":91,"c":72},"rd":{"s":93,"c":22,"tp":13,"sent":{"enthusiastic":0.55,"positive":0.27,"mixed":0.09,"negative":0.05,"neutral":0.1}}}},"cn":{"t":"This revival of Lloyd Webber's rock opera draws mixed reactions, with critics divided on whether the Regent's Park production successfully translates indoors—some hail it as a triumph while others find it falls flat at the Palladium.","rc":8},"sh":{"wk":"20260831","days":[{"m":null,"e":"19:30"},{"m":null,"e":"19:30"},{"m":null,"e":"19:30"},{"m":"14:30","e":"19:30"},{"m":null,"e":"19:30"},{"m":"14:30","e":"19:30"},{"m":null,"e":null}]},"pd":"2026-06-20"}